# schema.json is COMMITTED (see the `schema` target in the Makefile): it is
# //go:embed'ed into the binary and is what `gateway check` validates every
# production config against, so it must be a reviewable, version-controlled
# artifact rather than an unpinned build-time download.
# Everything else here stays ignored — notably schema.json.orig, the raw
# upstream download that `make schema` rebrands and then deletes.
*.json
!empty.json
!schema.json
